==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|en|air|man}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈɛə.mən/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈɛɹ.mən/}}
* {{audio|en|En-uk-airman.ogg|Audio (UK)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|airmen}}

# A [[pilot]] of an [[aircraft]].
# A member of an [[air force]].
# A person of a [[rank]] in the U.S. Air Force above airman basic and below airman first class. <!-- should this be capitalized? -->
# A naval seaman, especially one in the U.S. Navy, who works on and/or handles aircraft.

